WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.576
Want to rent out a camper or run a campsite
on Campigo?

00:00:04.576 --> 00:00:06.520
Click “Become a partner”.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:17.450
Choose “Camper or campsite owner”, tick what
you offer, and say whether you act privately
or as a company.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.030
Enter your name, email and a password —
that's all.

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:39.680
After signing up, a setup guide shows five
simple steps: confirm your email, add tax
details, get verified, connect payouts, and
add your first offer.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:44.779
First, tax details.

00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:52.590
In Poland you enter a PESEL or NIP number;
in other countries, a tax number in any
format.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:04.806
Next, verification: describe your offer and
attach a photo of the vehicle registration
or proof of location.

00:01:04.806 --> 00:01:07.990
We review requests within a few business
days.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:14.147
Once you're verified, connect payouts with
Stripe.

00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:17.960
Money reaches you 48 hours after the stay
ends.

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:28.503
Finally, add your first offer: photos,
description, prices, deposit and
cancellation rules.

00:01:28.503 --> 00:01:31.250
Once published, guests can book.

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.090
Questions?

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:47.562
We reply in Polish and English.

00:01:47.562 --> 00:01:49.690
Welcome to Campigo!

